BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2026 Southern End Dems Potluck Picnic in the Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260812T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260812T140000
UID:83bea14c79174908d2877b62b69cec74@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Picnic%20in%20the%20Park_20260613225500877710.png
DESCRIPTION:Join the Southern End Democrats for our potluck picnic in the 
 park—a fun-filled community celebration and fundraiser you won’t want 
 to miss! It's potluck\, but we'll make sure to have some basics covered. W
 hen you register\, you will get a link to the sign-up sheet to let everyon
 e know what you are bringing. This picnic will take the place of our regul
 arly scheduled second-Wednesday-of-the-month August meeting. Some business
  will be covered\, but the bulk of the evening will be dedicated to fun! W
 e
LOCATION:Huffnagle Park\, 20 Oak Ln\, Quarryville\, PA\, 17566
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/lancastercountydems/event/972888/
X-SOURCE:Lancaster County Dems (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
