BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Margarita’s in the ‘Ville 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260829T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260829T130000
UID:2bcef7cf72f0323ee4754f2219bfea0c@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/IMG_3953_20260620200644477198.jpeg
DESCRIPTION:🍹 EARLY BIRD TICKETS ARE AVAILABLE UNTIL 7/9 🍹 Join us f
 or Margaritas in the ’Ville on Saturday\, August 29\, from 1–4 PM at P
 hantom Power in Millersville! Enjoy: 🌮 Delicious tacos\, sides\, and de
 sserts 🍹 Margaritas and other fun beverages 🎶 Live music from Miller
 sville’s own Dillweed 🗳 Meet local Democratic candidates 💙 Family-
 friendly fun for all ages Bring your friends\, neighbors\, and family for 
 an afternoon of food\, music\, and community spirit. 🎟 Get your tickets
  today: https://secure.actblue.c
LOCATION:Phantom Power\, 121 W Frederick St\, Millersville\, PA\, 17551
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/lancastercountydems/event/976473/
X-SOURCE:Lancaster County Dems (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
