 ploads/event/mobilize_canvass_20260131224636775632.png
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we knock on doors and talk to voters to elect Brad 
 Chambers to the Pennsylvania State House! ________________________________
 ______ Brad Chambers is running for the PA State House in HD-41. He's is r
 unning to represent us in the State House to address the very issues he\, 
 his loved ones\, and his community face every day. His vision is the Penns
 ylvania we deserve\; one where everyone has a roof over their head\, acces
 s to lifesaving medical care\, and our schools have the funding our child
LOCATION:Ironville Community Park\, 711-725 Prospect Rd\, Columbia\, PA\, 
 17512
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/bradchambersforstatehouse/event/895362/
X-SOURCE:Lancaster County Dems (Mobilize)
